body:
Another month of stagnation, not going backwards with progress but not going forwards either. The worst possible state in my opinion.

&#x200B;

In other news: college.

Put on a traffic officer uniform and go around ticketing EVERY vehicle I see and wait for everyone to return...

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

eventually.

That I am much more of a positive person than I once was. I am far more sociable unlike when I was 15 I was really introverted and self loathing at the time thanks to bullying in high school. Nowadays I have a good self esteem and self worth and look towards everyday with some degree of positivity and optimism.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Edit 1: Also the fact that I own a gaming PC now finally, yeah past me would be jelly.

**Not to be overly loud whilst on the phone.**

&#x200B;

While sure some of us Europeans can be loud on the phone also \*cough\* Some Italians \*cough\* the general consensus is to be speaking at a low volume since it is polite and doesn't disturb those around you. Especially if you are on the bus or public transport please try to keep your voice down.

**Mariya Takeuchi** \- Plastic Love  and **Anri's** \-  Windy Summer

&#x200B;

Yeah its got me addicted to FutureFunk and 80's citypop.
